    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Recent Products Block for WooCommerce is a Gutenberg block plugin that allows you to showcase recently added WooCommerce products anywhere in your website using the block editor.</p>\n<p>The plugin integrates seamlessly with the WordPress Gutenberg editor and provides flexible customization options to create attractive product showcases for your customers.</p>\n<h4>Key Features</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Shortcode support.</li>\n<li>Product query options.</li>\n<li>Filter products by category, stock status, and more.</li>\n<li>Responsive column settings for desktop, tablet, and mobile.</li>\n<li>Custom column and row gap controls.</li>\n<li>Show or hide product elements such as image, title, rating, price, and add to cart button.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>How to use</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>Install and activate WooCommerce.</li>\n<li>Install and activate the Recent Products Block plugin.</li>\n<li>Open the Gutenberg editor.</li>\n<li>Add the “WooCommerce Recent Products” block from the Widgets category.</li>\n<li>Customize the block settings from the right sidebar.</li>\n<li>Publish and enjoy.</li>\n</ol>\n<h4>Feedback</h4>\n<p>Did you like this plugin? Do you have a feature request?</p>\n<p>Please share your feedback with us:<br />\nsupport@bplugins.com</p>\n<h3>External third-party library</h3>\n<p>This plugin connects to the following external third-party library from the admin dashboard:</p>\n<h4>bpl-tools</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Source / GitHub: https://github.com/bPlugins/bpl-tools</li>\n<li>License: GPL-2.0-or-later – https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-2.0.html</li>\n<li>Purpose: Shared utility library providing admin dashboard components and common Gutenberg editor controls.</li>\n<li>External Services: The library may connect to bPlugins, WordPress.org, and Freemius services for product data and checkout functionality. See full details: https://github.com/bPlugins/bpl-tools#external-requests&#8211;why-they-are-made</li>\n</ul>\n",
        "installation": "<h4>From Gutenberg Editor</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>Go to the WordPress Block Editor.</li>\n<li>Search for “WooCommerce Recent Products”.</li>\n<li>Click on the block to add it.</li>\n</ol>\n<h4>Download &amp; Upload</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>Download the plugin ZIP file.</li>\n<li>Go to Plugins &gt; Add New in your WordPress admin dashboard.</li>\n<li>Click “Upload Plugin”.</li>\n<li>Upload the <code>recent-products-block.zip</code> file.</li>\n<li>Click “Install Now”.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin.</li>\n</ol>\n<h4>Manual Installation</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>Download and extract the plugin files.</li>\n<li>Upload the plugin folder to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code> directory.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the Plugins menu in WordPress.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id=\"is%20the%20woocommerce%20recent%20products%20plugin%20free%3F\">\nIs the WooCommerce Recent Products plugin free?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, the plugin is completely free to use.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"does%20it%20work%20with%20any%20wordpress%20theme%3F\">\nDoes it work with any WordPress theme?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, it works with all standard WordPress themes.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"can%20i%20customize%20the%20block%20settings%3F\">\nCan I customize the block settings?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, all block settings can be customized from the Gutenberg editor sidebar.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"can%20i%20reuse%20the%20block%20multiple%20times%3F\">\nCan I reuse the block multiple times?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, you can use the block unlimited times on your website.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"where%20can%20i%20get%20support%3F\">\nWhere can I get support?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>You can get support here:<br />\nhttps://wordpress.org/support/plugin/recent-products-block/</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>2.0.1</h4>\n<p>-20 MAY 2026</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed plugin guideline compliance issues.</li>\n<li>Improved readme structure and formatting.</li>\n<li>Minor improvements and fixes.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Showcase recently added WooCommerce products anywhere in the Gutenberg editor with flexible display settings .",
    "description": "<p>Recent Products Block for WooCommerce is a Gutenberg block plugin that allows you to showcase recently added WooCommerce products anywhere in your website using the block editor.</p>\n<p>The plugin integrates seamlessly with the WordPress Gutenberg editor and provides flexible customization options to create attractive product showcases for your customers.</p>\n<h4>Key Features</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Shortcode support.</li>\n<li>Product query options.</li>\n<li>Filter products by category, stock status, and more.</li>\n<li>Responsive column settings for desktop, tablet, and mobile.</li>\n<li>Custom column and row gap controls.</li>\n<li>Show or hide product elements such as image, title, rating, price, and add to cart button.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>How to use</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>Install and activate WooCommerce.</li>\n<li>Install and activate the Recent Products Block plugin.</li>\n<li>Open the Gutenberg editor.</li>\n<li>Add the “WooCommerce Recent Products” block from the Widgets category.</li>\n<li>Customize the block settings from the right sidebar.</li>\n<li>Publish and enjoy.</li>\n</ol>\n<h4>Feedback</h4>\n<p>Did you like this plugin? Do you have a feature request?</p>\n<p>Please share your feedback with us:<br />\nsupport@bplugins.com</p>\n<h3>External third-party library</h3>\n<p>This plugin connects to the following external third-party library from the admin dashboard:</p>\n<h4>bpl-tools</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Source / GitHub: https://github.com/bPlugins/bpl-tools</li>\n<li>License: GPL-2.0-or-later – https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-2.0.html</li>\n<li>Purpose: Shared utility library providing admin dashboard components and common Gutenberg editor controls.</li>\n<li>External Services: The library may connect to bPlugins, WordPress.org, and Freemius services for product data and checkout functionality. See full details: https://github.com/bPlugins/bpl-tools#external-requests&#8211;why-they-are-made</li>\n</ul>\n",
